### Variables de entorno
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### 1. Iniciar Sesión (Login)
# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "@",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Guardar el token de la respuesta automáticamente
@authToken = {{loginRequest.response.body.data.access_token}}

### 3. Consultar datos del usuario autenticado (/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Cerrar sesión (/logout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Listar documentos del tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Ejecutar Checkout sobre el documento (adquirir candado)
# Coloca el id que devuelve el listado anterior
@documentId = PEGA_AQUI_UN_UUID_DE_DOCUMENTO
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Modificación de cláusulas de entrega"
}

### 7. Intentar adquirir candado concurrentemente (Debe retornar 423 Locked)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Liberar candado
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/discard-checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}